{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ogr\u00fcuk is a 3D platformer stealth game where ogres have captured all your dogs! You must save them before their cooking pot is at the right temperature!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624360/extras/cooking_pot.gif?t=1745400218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sneak between  monsters and keep away from their lights or you'll also be their dinner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624360/extras/ogre_light_3.gif?t=1745400218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key features of the demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stealth: sneak between ogres and cursed lamps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mystical powers: run faster or be invisible for a short period of time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hide from the light by crouching down.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 levels with increasing difficulty </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 dogs to save!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bonus: collect and save 12 mice!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a dangerous and mysterious world</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3624360?t=1745400218","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624360/dee72916d336b2e2fc30499da1c323e1338d5d51/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745400218","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624360/6493af81d8c231dce2f71271a2880f05801f1eae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745400218","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624360/6493af81d8c231dce2f71271a2880f05801f1eae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745400218","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","i